<p>
                        When a student opens a Java programming
                        application, the operating system
                        manages the memory needed by the
                        application, allows it to use the
                        processor, and displays its interface.
                    </p>
</div>
<h3>Importance</h3>
<p>
                    An operating system makes computer hardware
                    usable and provides the basic services
                    required by applications.
                </p>
